<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  {% set loadPagefindStyles = true %}
  {% include "components/document-head.njk" %}
  <script>
    document.documentElement.classList.add('js');
  </script>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Geist+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Rajdhani:wght@700&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script src="/assets/lucide.min.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/assets/copy-code.js" defer></script>
  <script type="module" src="/assets/mermaid.js"></script>
  <script src="/pagefind/pagefind-component-ui.js" type="module"></script>
  <script>window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => { if (typeof lucide !== 'undefined') lucide.createIcons(); });</script>
</head>
<body class="docs-body">{%- if cliExplorer -%}
  <!--
  THESIS: The live CLI should read as navigable topology sourced from code, refusing a static option table as the only representation.
  OWN-WORLD: Mesh documentation surfaces, precise 1px seams, 8px geometry, Electric Blue interaction, Geist for reading, and Geist Mono only for syntax.
  STORY: A developer searches or expands from mesh-llm, inspects one authoritative node, and copies a valid invocation while the prose guide remains nearby.
  FIRST VIEWPORT: Docs navigation stays fixed; the page title and short explanation lead into a wide search-and-tree workspace with a quiet inspector rail.
  FORM: Established-world local extension in Read mode with an embedded Operate tool; seed key not-applicable-local-extension.
  FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md
  -->{%- endif %}
  <pagefind-config bundle-path="/pagefind/" base-url="/"></pagefind-config>
  {% include "nav.njk" %}
  {{ content | safe }}
  <pagefind-modal reset-on-close data-pf-theme="dark" data-pagefind-ignore="all"></pagefind-modal>
</body>
</html>
